  "steps": [
    "Blitz everything except the cooking oil in a blender until smooth. Let the batter rest for 5 minutes to thicken.",
    "Warm a non-stick pan over medium heat and brush with a little oil.",
    "Pour in small rounds of batter and cook until bubbles form on top and the edges look set, about 2–3 minutes.",
    "Flip gently and cook the other side until golden.",
    "Stack high and serve with extra banana, berries and a final drizzle of maple syrup."
  ],
  "notes": "The riper the bananas the sweeter the pancakes — those spotty ones nobody wants to eat are perfect here."
